---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About newskrypt - Financial Intelligence & Digital Asset Journalism"
  description="Learn about the editorial mission, leadership, research standards, and independence policies of newskrypt."
  canonicalUrl="https://cryptopulse.news/about"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    <header class="mb-12 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-700 text-xs font-bold mb-4">
        <span>⚡</span>
        <span>Institutional Crypto Intelligence</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-black tracking-tight mb-4">
        About newskrypt
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-700 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Delivering unfiltered market clarity, cryptographic verification, and institutional-grade financial analysis to the decentralized economy.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-black text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      
      <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-black mb-4">Our Editorial Mission</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-black">
          Founded by seasoned financial journalists and cryptographic researchers, <strong class="text-black">newskrypt</strong> exists to provide objective, non-sensationalized, and mathematically grounded reporting on digital assets, blockchain engineering, and monetary macroeconomics.
        </p>
        <p class="text-black">
          As capital markets integrate with public distributed ledgers, retail investors and institutional fiduciaries require news coverage uncompromised by token promotional hype, undisclosed venture sponsorships, or coordinated market making campaigns.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🔍</div>
          <h3 class="text-black font-bold text-base mb-2">Primary Verification</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">We audit raw mempool data, verify contract bytecode, and review original legislative filings before reporting conclusions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">⚖️</div>
          <h3 class="text-black font-bold text-base mb-2">Editorial Independence</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">Strict firewall separating reporting desks from advertising partners. No staff member may trade tokens based on non-public journalistic findings.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🌐</div>
          <h3 class="text-black font-bold text-base mb-2">Global Perspective</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">Bureaus tracking regulatory developments across Washington, Brussels, Tokyo, Singapore, and London in real time.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-black mb-4">Core Principles (E-E-A-T)</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 list-disc pl-5 text-black">
          <li><strong class="text-black">Experience:</strong> Our beat reporters have spent years evaluating codebases, engaging directly with core protocol developers, and monitoring live liquidity stress events.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-black">Expertise:</strong> Our writing staff holds postgraduate degrees in quantitative finance, law, applied cryptography, and computer science.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-black">Authoritativeness:</strong> We provide transparent primary source links, court docket links, and on-chain explorer proofs in every published piece.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-black">Trustworthiness:</strong> We operate a transparent, publicly visible corrections process and enforce comprehensive disclaimers ensuring reader asset protection.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>